{"4284620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SEGMENTS", "steam_appid": 4284620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284620/extras/6fd6ea933ba3b2cc4260ed0650d151ca.avif?t=1779009451\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Segments is an atmospheric horror presented in the format of a set of independent video recordings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each segment is a separate incident recorded on camera by a person who encountered abnormal activity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The records have their own designations and are accompanied by background information:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >date</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >period</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >place of discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and a brief description of what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All events are reproduced in the first person and presented without interpretation — exactly in the form in which they were recorded by the camera operator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Segments is perceived not as a single story, but as an archive of documented cases of an unknown nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is limited by the perspective of the operator's camera and focuses on observing what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each segment lasts 5-7 minutes and is a completed recording containing:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >recording of abnormal activity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >changes in the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >visual distortions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the appearance of unknown entities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >has no influence on the development of events</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >has no interaction tools</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cannot counteract what is happening</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His role is to review and relive the material that has already been recorded.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284620/extras/6fd6ea933ba3b2cc4260ed0650d151ca.avif?t=1779009451\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Segments is an atmospheric horror presented in the format of a set of independent video recordings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each segment is a separate incident recorded on camera by a person who encountered abnormal activity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The records have their own designations and are accompanied by background information:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >date</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >period</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >place of discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and a brief description of what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All events are reproduced in the first person and presented without interpretation — exactly in the form in which they were recorded by the camera operator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Segments is perceived not as a single story, but as an archive of documented cases of an unknown nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is limited by the perspective of the operator's camera and focuses on observing what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each segment lasts 5-7 minutes and is a completed recording containing:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >recording of abnormal activity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >changes in the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >visual distortions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the appearance of unknown entities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >has no influence on the development of events</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >has no interaction tools</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cannot counteract what is happening</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His role is to review and relive the material that has already been recorded.</p>", "short_description": "SEGMENTS - is an atmospheric horror game where you investigate recordings of anomalous incidents known as SEGMENTS. Each SEGMENT is a captured-on-tape encounter with unexplained anomalous activity, experienced through the eyes of the person who recorded it", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284620/625257c9ccc7ec41fe76b785864f865f37592b72/header.jpg?t=1779009451", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284620/0a5d46eccd1f0e21332943f2fb0ab481893551bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779009451", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4284620/0a5d46eccd1f0e21332943f2fb0ab481893551bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779009451", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li>